    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "72b5737102ae0c3f9b01": "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew.  The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done.  It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining.  Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?",
        "7e3f55fb2008c4cf778e": "Remember, all things are connected. If the beasts were gone from the land, our kind would die from a great loneliness of spirit, for whatever happens to the beasts also happens to the Tauren. Whatever befalls Azeroth befalls all those that inhabit it. \n",
        "98cba2a5c1462d8528c0": "I can not train you, young one.\n",
        "e0944abc4d01eb473466": "I wish to train.\n"
      },
      "name": "Holt Thunderhorn",
      "subName": "Hunter Trainer",
      "translationMetadata": {
        "fields": {
          "dialogue.72b5737102ae0c3f9b01": {
